{
    "title": "Sindibad: Flights and Hotels",
    "description": "Sindibad for all your travels\r\nSindibad is the first integrated application for online airline ticket bookings in Iraq. It offers comprehensive travel information and services, all within a user-friendly interface. Whether you're planning a trip within Iraq or abroad, Sindibad has got you covered with its easy-to-use features.\r\n\r\nSindibad app features\r\n\u2022 Flight Search: Easily search for flights to any destination within and outside Iraq.\r\n\u2022 Hotel Search: Find and book hotels and hostels in any country within seconds.\r\n\u2022 Results Categorization: Filter and view search results based on price, date, and more, making your search process more convenient.\r\nMultiple Payment Methods: Pay online or in cash from anywhere you are.\r\n\u2022 Customer Support: Reach out to our dedicated customer support team, available 24/7.\r\n\u2022 Passport Scanning: Scan your passport to automatically enter your information, saving you time.\r\n\r\nSearch for all flights\r\n Sindibad is the go-to app for online flight reservations. Search for flights to any country, city, or airport worldwide. It provides international flights to various destinations as well as domestic flights within Iraq. You can easily find flights from Baghdad Airport to Erbil, Basra, Sulaymaniyah, and other airports within Iraq.\r\n\r\nThe latest and best travel deals\r\n Stay updated with the latest and most competitive ticket prices within the Sindibad  app. We ensure that the prices displayed are always up to date, allowing you to find the cheapest airline tickets for your destination across multiple airlines. Sindibad is your ultimate source for all flight prices.\r\n\r\nCustomer Partners Team, your source for all travel information\r\n Our customer support team is dedicated to providing you with assistance throughout your journey. Whether you have inquiries or need advice regarding your trip, our team is available 24/7, including holidays. We aim to respond promptly and offer the information you require before and after your travel. Rest assured, we will also keep you informed of any flight-related emergencies such as cancellations or date changes, ensuring your travel experience is stress-free.\r\n\r\nAll Airlines in One Place\r\n Sindibad brings together all airlines and air carriers in a single platform. This allows you to choose your preferred airline from a wide range of options available for your specific flight. Whether you prefer Iraqi Airways, Fly Baghdad, Royal Jordanian, Mahan, Turkish Airlines, Anadolu Jet, Emirates Airlines, Qatar Airways, or many others, you'll find them all on Sindibad.\r\n\r\nFrom one application, travel to all destinations\r\n With Sindibad, you have the freedom to travel to any destination of your choice. From major cities to remote airports, you can book flights to locations worldwide. Whether you wish to explore Turkey, Dubai, Tehran, Jordan, Malaysia, Oman, or any other country, Sindibad makes it possible.\r\n\r\nEasy Access to Tickets\r\nThe \"My Trips\" section of the app allows you to access your airline ticket anytime, anywhere. You can view, download, and even print your ticket if needed, ensuring convenience and peace of mind throughout your journey.\r\nSindibad for all your travels.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Sindibad for all your travels<br>Sindibad is the first integrated application for online airline ticket bookings in Iraq. It offers comprehensive travel information and services, all within a user-friendly interface. Whether you&#39;re planning a trip within Iraq or abroad, Sindibad has got you covered with its easy-to-use features.<br><br>Sindibad app features<br>\u2022 Flight Search: Easily search for flights to any destination within and outside Iraq.<br>\u2022 Hotel Search: Find and book hotels and hostels in any country within seconds.<br>\u2022 Results Categorization: Filter and view search results based on price, date, and more, making your search process more convenient.<br>Multiple Payment Methods: Pay online or in cash from anywhere you are.<br>\u2022 Customer Support: Reach out to our dedicated customer support team, available 24/7.<br>\u2022 Passport Scanning: Scan your passport to automatically enter your information, saving you time.<br><br>Search for all flights<br> Sindibad is the go-to app for online flight reservations. Search for flights to any country, city, or airport worldwide. It provides international flights to various destinations as well as domestic flights within Iraq. You can easily find flights from Baghdad Airport to Erbil, Basra, Sulaymaniyah, and other airports within Iraq.<br><br>The latest and best travel deals<br> Stay updated with the latest and most competitive ticket prices within the Sindibad  app. We ensure that the prices displayed are always up to date, allowing you to find the cheapest airline tickets for your destination across multiple airlines. Sindibad is your ultimate source for all flight prices.<br><br>Customer Partners Team, your source for all travel information<br> Our customer support team is dedicated to providing you with assistance throughout your journey. Whether you have inquiries or need advice regarding your trip, our team is available 24/7, including holidays. We aim to respond promptly and offer the information you require before and after your travel. Rest assured, we will also keep you informed of any flight-related emergencies such as cancellations or date changes, ensuring your travel experience is stress-free.<br><br>All Airlines in One Place<br> Sindibad brings together all airlines and air carriers in a single platform. This allows you to choose your preferred airline from a wide range of options available for your specific flight. Whether you prefer Iraqi Airways, Fly Baghdad, Royal Jordanian, Mahan, Turkish Airlines, Anadolu Jet, Emirates Airlines, Qatar Airways, or many others, you&#39;ll find them all on Sindibad.<br><br>From one application, travel to all destinations<br> With Sindibad, you have the freedom to travel to any destination of your choice. From major cities to remote airports, you can book flights to locations worldwide. Whether you wish to explore Turkey, Dubai, Tehran, Jordan, Malaysia, Oman, or any other country, Sindibad makes it possible.<br><br>Easy Access to Tickets<br>The &quot;My Trips&quot; section of the app allows you to access your airline ticket anytime, anywhere. You can view, download, and even print your ticket if needed, ensuring convenience and peace of mind throughout your journey.<br>Sindibad for all your travels.",
